li><li>    4 Arenas<br></li><li>    Deadly Stage Hazards<br></li><li>    Random Pickups<br></li><li>    End-Game Statistics<br></li><li>    Target Practice Mode with Steam Leaderboards</li></ul><strong><br>Planned Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    Solo Arcade Mode with Enemy AI<br></li><li>    More Characters, Weapons<br></li><li>    Mini-Games with Steam leaderboards</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/522950/extras/c362ee05b53dcb2a6e7e0bde45b9c650.avif?t=1709643528\" width=624 height=749 /></span>",
