                        "review": "I can only reasonably assume it`s long since been abandoned as there`s just no content here. Graphics and music show some promise but there`s no single player gameplay at all and the Traing and Target Practice levels will take you less than a minute before you realise there`s just nothing for you to do. Apparently multiplayer might function but I wouldn`t buy it find out.\nThis is an empty shell waiting for the gameplay and levels to be added and considering how long it`s been on Steam it`s not likely to ever happen. \nNo, of course I don`t recommend it.",
